<title>USA: Arizona Electric bonds restructured, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Arizona Electric bonds restructured, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it restructured National Rural Utilities Cooperative Finance Corp, Ariz.'s $25.5 million bond deal, for Arizona Electric Power Co, raising yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>National Rural Utilities</p>
<p>Cooperative Finance Corporation</p>
<p>Arizona Electric Power Cooperative, Inc.</p>
<p>RE: $25,525,000*</p>
<p>Verbal award.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa3		 S&amp;P: AA-</p>
<p>    DATED: 03/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 06/01 &amp; 12/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		AMOUNT*   AMOUNT*   COUPON     PRICE</p>
<p>			   (6/1)    (12/1)</p>
<p>1997			--	 895M    3.65  %    100.00</p>
<p>1998		     920M	945M    3.85  %    100.00</p>
<p>1999		     970M    1,000M    4.00  %	4.10</p>
<p>2000		   1,030M    1,065M    4.25  %	4.35</p>
<p>2001		   1,095M    1,125M    4.35  %	4.45</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>2002		   1,160M    1,195M    4.45  %	4.55</p>
<p>2003			--     2,500M    4.65  %    100.00</p>
<p>2004			--     2,655M    4.75  %    100.00</p>
<p>2005			--     2,815M    4.85  %    100.00</p>
<p>2006			--     2,985M    4.95  %    100.00</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>2007			--     3,170M    5.05  %    100.00</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>TERM BONDS 2003-2007 WILL HAVE A SINKING FUND BEGINNING 6/1</p>
<p>FOR EACH MATURITY.</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, February 21, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on March 4, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
